	"data": "Project: Calcifer Vault\n\nVision\nReplace monolithic memory files with an atomic-note Obsidian vault. As the knowledge base grows, context quality stays high because context is composed from small precise pieces rather than degrading as one big blob. cithoreal navigates with graph view; Calcifer queries via REST API and RAG. Same source of truth, two interfaces.\n\nStatus\nPhase 3 complete. Phase 4 (long-term health) ongoing.\n\n✅ Phase 0 — Foundations (complete)\n[x] Forgejo repo…",
